 	"""Grand total and amount due now for ``method`` of the room quotes of one booking,
 	with the same deposit rules ``create_booking`` applies. ``loaded`` is a list of
@@ -695,11 +723,14 @@ def resend_confirmation(booking: str) -> dict:
 
